          <h2 class="block-title">Not an Empty Boilerplate: A Real-World Automotive Marketplace</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="block-text">
          Generic multiplatform templates fail because they offer empty counter apps. Zora KMP Kits are built around a concrete, high-friction multi-billion dollar vertical: <strong>the $30B+ North American automotive salvage & used parts industry</strong> (Auto Salvage Yards / Junkyards / Pick-n-Pull).
        </p>

        <div class="grid-two-col">
          <div class="machined-card">
            <h3 class="card-title">The Driver & Mechanic Pain</h3>
            <p class="card-desc">
              Locating an OEM replacement part requires hours of phone calls and complex technical jargon drivers do not speak. Zora bridges this with conversational NLP, translating colloquial queries into structured OEM specifications and VIN decoding.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="machined-card">
            <h3 class="card-title">The Salvage Yard "Ghost Inventory"</h3>
            <p class="card-desc">
              Yards purchase auction vehicles faster than they can catalog individual parts. Instead of demanding impossible manual cataloging, Zora inverts the model: emitting real-time demand alerts when a driver searches for a compatible part in their yard.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
