              </div>
              <div class="bullet-item">
                <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                <div><strong>Compose Multiplatform & Material 3:</strong> Shared UI running natively on Android DEX and iOS Darwin targets.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bullet-item">
                <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
