                <div><strong>Hybrid Google AI Copilot:</strong> On-Device AI (Gemini Nano / LiteRT) for instant offline intent classification + Google Cloud Gemini API for deep mechanical troubleshooting.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bullet-item">
                <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                <div><strong>Generative Chat UI via <code>json-to-compose</code>:</strong> The AI dynamically outputs typed Server-Driven UI (SDUI) JSON payloads rendered in-chat as visual part inspection cards, location diagrams, and repair estimate components.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bullet-item">
                <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
