          Commercial Zora Kits are protected by a developer-friendly, zero-friction DRM architecture engineered directly inside <strong>KMP-CLI</strong>:
        </p>

        <div class="grid-three-col">
          <div class="machined-card">
            <span class="card-metric">2 SEATS</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Hardware Binding</h3>
            <p class="card-desc">
              Licenses are cryptographically linked to your workstation's hardware UUID (<code>IOPlatformUUID</code> on macOS, <code>machine-id</code> on Linux). Allows up to 2 simultaneous machines (e.g. work laptop + desktop).
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="machined-card">
            <span class="card-metric">CLOUDFLARE R2</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Remote Kit Delivery</h3>
            <p class="card-desc">
